   "title": "2027: Tinubu, Oborevwori assured of victory in Delta",
   "url": "https://www.vanguardngr.com/2026/11/2027-tinubu-oborevwori-assured-of-victory-in-delta-olejeme/",
   "domain": "vanguardngr.com",
