   "domain": "inquirer.net",
   "source": "inquirer.net",
   "published": "Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:29:25 +0000",
   "_dt": 1794835765.0,
   "ageDays": 0.12,
   "summary": "Theresa Lazaro said that negotiators had made substantial progress but remained divided on key issues, including the code’s geographic scope, definition of terms and whether it would be legally binding. READ: Marcos says commitment to int’l law must be reflected in actions Asean and China pledged in 2002 to come up with a COC on the South China Sea, a framework that seeks to prevent conflict through diplomatic means but it has remained elusive due to slow progress.",
   "summary_zh": "特蕾莎·拉扎罗表示，谈判代表已取得实质性进展，但在若干关键问题上仍存在分歧，包括该准则的地域适用范围、术语定义，以及其是否具有法律约束力。阅读：马科斯称，遵守国际法的承诺必须体现在行动中。东盟和中国于2002年承诺就南海行为准则达成一致，该准则旨在通过外交手段防止冲突，但由于进展缓慢，这一准则至今仍未能实现。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Batongbacal said he had earlier assessed that there was a “big chance” negotiations would not be concluded during the Philippines’ chairship of the Association of Southeast Asian Nations (Asean), despite Manila’s push to complete the binding agreement under its leadership. “It’s not unexpected, and I think even within the different ministries of the different countries, they also were aware of that possibility. So it’s not surprising,” he said at the Manila Dialogue on the South China Sea. On Sunday, Foreign Affairs Secretary Ma. Theresa Lazaro said that negotiators had made substantial progress but remained divided on key issues, including the code’s geographic scope, definition of terms and whether it would be legally binding. She said the parties had reached provisional agreement on about 80 percent of the draft, up from roughly 50 percent when the Philippines assumed the Asean chairmanship. READ: Marcos says commitment to int’l law must be reflected in actions Asean and China pledged in 2002 to come up with a COC on the South China Sea, a framework that seeks to prevent conflict through diplomatic means but it has remained elusive due to slow progress. /dl Your subscription could not be saved. Please try again. Your subscription has been successful. For comprehensive coverage, in-depth analysis, visit our special page for West Philippine Sea updates . Stay informed with articles, videos, and expert opinions",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
