   "summary": "HD Hyundai Heavy Industries said Monday it has secured a 272.1 billion-won ($203.6 million) contract to build four liquefied petroleum gas (LPG) carriers.",
   "summary_zh": "HD现代重工周一表示，公司已获得一份价值2721亿韩元（2.036亿美元）的合同，将建造4艘液化石油气运输船。",
