   "title": "Seoul to closely monitor N. Korean official's Russia trip before Trump-Xi-Putin summit",
   "url": "https://www.koreatimes.co.kr/world/20261116/seoul-to-closely-monitor-n-korean-officials-russia-trip-before-trump-xi-putin-summit",
   "domain": "koreatimes.co.kr",
