   "published": "Mon, 16 Nov 2026 02:52:02 GMT",
   "_dt": 1794797522.0,
   "ageDays": 0.57,
   "summary": "Korea to the Middle East fell month-on-month in October, while those to the United States rose, the customs agency said Monday. The average shipping charge for a 40-foot container from Korea to the Middle East fell 4.2 percent from a month earlier to 8.63 million won ($6,460) in October, according to data from the Korea Customs Service.",
   "summary_zh": "韩国关税厅周一表示，10月韩国至中东的集装箱平均海运费环比下降，而发往美国的海运费则有所上升。据韩国关税厅数据，10月韩国至中东的40英尺集装箱平均海运费较上月下降4.2%，降至863万韩元（6,460美元）。",
   "summarySource": "fulltext",
   "body": "Container shipping costs from Korea to the Middle East fell month-on-month in October, while those to the United States rose, the customs agency said Monday. The average shipping charge for a 40-foot container from Korea to the Middle East fell 4.2 percent from a month earlier to 8.63 million won ($6,460) in October, according to data from the Korea Customs Service. The figure had been rising since March before beginning to fluctuate in August. The average shipping charge for containers bound for the US west coast edged up 0.01 percent to 9.37 million won, while that for containers bound for the east coast rose 1.2 percent to 9.45 million won. Shipping costs to the European Union, meanwhile, dropped 9.2 percent to 4.54 million won. The figures include freight rates, commissions and other charges reported by local exporters, according to the agency",
   "bodyLevel": "fulltext",
