   "_dt": 1794791285.0,
   "ageDays": 0.64,
   "summary": "The House of Representatives has been urged to pass the Customs, Excise Tariffs, etc. (Consolidation) Act (CETA) Amendment Bill, popularly known as the Sugar-Sweetened Beverage (SSB) tax Amendment bill.",
   "summary_zh": "各方敦促众议院通过《关税、消费税等（合并）法》（CETA）修正案，该法案通常被称为《含糖饮料（SSB）税修正案》。",
