   "body": "While continent offers vast potential, fierce competition will make profits harder to achieve Chinese companies are flocking to Africa, but with the emphasis on building factories rather than exporting goods, as the continent's growing population and industrialization drive create new opportunities for manufacturers facing slowing demand and fierce competition at home",
